# Requirements this host cannot enforce

Generated by the NIST 800-171r3 Rocky 9 overlay. Managed by Ansible; edits are
overwritten.

800-171r3 has 97 active security requirements. This overlay classifies each by
what a Rocky Linux 9 host can actually enforce. The requirements below are
**not** satisfied by any host configuration. Each needs a documented
organizational control before this system may be authorized to process CUI.

The assessment tool reports these as `NOT_APPLICABLE(host)` rather than `PASS`,
so a clean assessment never implies the organization's obligations are met.

